      "side": 1,
      "message": "So, with this change you would wait a concurrent zram_writeback_endio() to finish before freeing wb_ctl. But that means you allow `wb_ctl-\u003edone_reqs` to contain elements when you are freeing `wb_ctl`. Wouldn\u0027t that leak memory?\n\nAt line 824 you also have `WARN_ON(!list_empty(\u0026wb_ctl-\u003edone_reqs))`. If you allow zram_writeback_endio() to run concurrently with that code, then this warning will be triggered.\n\nI don\u0027t think you are properly resolving this race with this change.",
